  scoreCounter: {fileID: 2004660625}
  stepTextMesh: {fileID: 1653942558}
  stepTexts:
  - Of course you'll have a second chance, now you can do it! Just remeber, avoid
    them, don't touch them.
  - Alright, alright. Now let's stop playing, avoid the notes.
  - Huhnm... You have to go up or down in order to avoid the notes, just to remeber.
  nextStepTextMesh: {fileID: 1775727205}
  nextStepTexts:
  - You just wanted to fell the game first, right? I get you... well done!
  - Best of three, I guess, god joob.
  - Guess you hadn't undestood it then... my apologies. I had one job, and I failed
    you. But good thing you undestand it now.
